Subject: [PATCH 5/8] fix(zsh): override Oh My Zsh d function with custom git
 diff

Oh My Zsh's directories.zsh defines 'd' as a directory stack viewer,
which conflicts with our custom git diff function. Undefine the
Oh My Zsh version and re-autoload our custom function to ensure
it takes precedence.
